Proper lighting

## What actually happened

Lighting behaving strangely on different `far` settings of the orthographic camera set in Blender:

### 30
![30](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/32136879/163324026-176512f4-9152-405d-b6b8-1b18a3859d4d.png)
